# Species registry for the UV/AOP model.
# One species per line. run_model.R reads ONLY this list and writes
# SPECIES.DAT itself, supplying every initial concentration from the
# current substep's state -- so there are no _0 placeholders here and
# no species can be silently reset to zero between substeps.
# To add a species: add it here and to MODEL_template.DAT. Nothing else.
HO*
DIOXANE
X
H2O2
TOC
HOCl
OCl-
HCO3-
CO3--
NH2Cl
NHCl2
H+
OH-
H2O
O*-
HO2*
HO2-
O2*-
O2
O3*-
O2--
ClO*
O3
O4--
ClO2
ClO3-
ClO2-
H2CO3
CO3*-
Cl*
Cl-
Cl2
Cl2*-
Cl2O2
Cl2O3
Cl3-
ClO2*
ClOH*-
HClOH*
HNO
HNO2
N2
N2O
N2O3
N2O4
NCl2*
NCl3
NH2*
NH2O2*
NH3
NH4+
NHCl*
NHClO2*
NO*
NO2*
NO2-
NO2Cl
NO3-
NOH
ONOO*
ONOO-
ONOOH
